[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=20 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="第二份副本带回来以后，最先惹起争论的是一行很不起眼的数字。主件上像是十五，副本上像是十六，两个人各拿放大镜看了半天，谁也没能说服谁。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="会影响后面所有结论吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="看它对应什么。如果只是页数，不会；如果是关机顺序，可能会。先别为了把表填满，就替它挑一个。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们顺着索引找到原项，发现那不是顺序，而是一组已经停用的端口编号。拉姆森把结构图展开，指出十五和十六的外部接口本来就在同一块板上，换板时很容易抄错。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="这能解释错在哪儿，不证明哪一边是对的。我们先把这块板标成待确认，别拿它下接线命令。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="那我们白跑了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="怎么会。现在知道这里不能照着抄着用了。如果没去拿副本，回来的人说不定已经把电接上了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把那一格涂成斜线，和旁边能确认的项目区分。副本没有让所有问题变少，却让一些原先太光滑的答案露出了接缝。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这一处，两份都留着完整的“可拒绝”。改成“待批准”的只有后来发出来的摘抄。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="对。这件现在能独立核了。把三份图放一起，标来源。不要因为端口还有疑点，就让别人说全部都无法确认。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻听完，让一位工人把这个对照带给维修班。工人问要不要把错误摘抄当场烧掉，免得以后再用错。你犹豫了一下，摇头，要求加封说明留底。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="它本身也是谁改过记录的证据。不能只留下我们觉得好的版本。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="另外给实际操作的人一份核验过的步骤，别让他们在三张互相打架的纸里自己赌。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们最后没有把桌上合成一本“真相档案”。有原件，有不同版本，有核验说明，也有仍然不能接入的部分。德雷顿替它们各做一种手感不同的纸签，说灯坏了也能分清。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="蓝签是可用，红签是隔离？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="别只认颜色。蓝的是两个折角，红的是一个，摸也知道。上次进水以后它们都差不多黑。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她让你闭眼试了一遍，你摸错了第一张，第二遍全对。拉姆森在旁边说折角也会湿，最好加一层布签。于是那份记录继续被改得更好用，没有谁觉得自己的办法先提出来，就不能再被补充。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

